OL,3,GNEWSAMayor launches #60m pothole repair
OL,4,Aprogramme
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mayor of Greater Manchester has
OL,7,Funveiled a #60m pothole repair
OL,8,Fprogramme, saying people from all 10
OL,9,Fboroughs had complained to her about
OL,10,Fthe issue.
OL,12,FBev Craig said funding would be made
OL,13,Favailable to all of the boroughs and it
OL,14,Fwould be enough to repair and maintain
OL,15,Fover a million square metres of road.
OL,17,FCraig had promised to repair more roads
OL,18,Fand make sure pavements were safe
OL,19,Fduring her election campaign.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
