OL,3,GNEWSAMayor launches #60m pothole repair
OL,4,Aprogramme
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Rod Dennis from the RAC said what
OL,7,Fwas needed to fix "Britain's pothole
OL,8,Fwoes, and those we see in Manchester,
OL,9,Fis guaranteed long-term funding over
OL,10,Fmany, many years".
